{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaos\u00a0Invasion\u00a0TD\u00a0\uff1aThe\u00a0Rush\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0Undead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chaos\u00a0Invasion\u00a0TD&quot;\u00a0\u2013\u00a0Immerse\u00a0Yourself\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a0Fantasy\u00a02D\u00a0Strategy\u00a0Tower\u00a0Defense\u00a0Epic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build.\u00a0Defend.\u00a0Conquer.\u00a0The\u00a0chaos\u00a0awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0a\u00a0continent\u00a0shrouded\u00a0in\u00a0darkness,\u00a0bandits,\u00a0ferocious\u00a0orcs,\u00a0and\u00a0an\u00a0undead\u00a0legion\u00a0unleash\u00a0chaos\u00a0\u2013\u00a0your\u00a0wisdom\u00a0and\u00a0strategy\u00a0are\u00a0the\u00a0only\u00a0hope\u00a0to\u00a0defend\u00a0the\u00a0last\u00a0standing\u00a0bastion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit\u00a0from\u00a06\u00a0unique\u00a0classes\u00a0\u2013\u00a0Swordsman,\u00a0Archer,\u00a0Mage,\u00a0Guardian,\u00a0Axe\u00a0Warrior,\u00a0and\u00a0Rouge\u2013\u00a0each\u00a0with\u00a0customizable\u00a0progression\u00a0paths.\u00a0Unlock\u00a0advanced\u00a0evolutions\u00a0through\u00a0combat\u00a0experience\u00a0to\u00a0forge\u00a0a\u00a0legion\u00a0as\u00a0unique\u00a0as\u00a0your\u00a0tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core\u00a0Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6\u00a0Class\u00a0Branches,\u00a0Endless\u00a0Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose\u00a0from\u00a0Swordsman,\u00a0Archer,\u00a0Mage,\u00a0Guardian,\u00a0Axe\u00a0Warrior,\u00a0and\u00a0Thief.\u00a0Each\u00a0class\u00a0evolves\u00a0through\u00a0battle,\u00a0letting\u00a0you\u00a0craft\u00a0a\u00a0personalized\u00a0army\u00a0with\u00a0distinct\u00a0skills\u00a0and\u00a0playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic\u00a0Loot\u00a0&amp;\u00a0Equipment\u00a0System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies\u00a0drop\u00a0rare\u00a0weapons\u00a0and\u00a0armor\u00a0to\u00a0boost\u00a0your\u00a0units\u2019\u00a0stats\u00a0in\u00a0real\u00a0time.\u00a0Every\u00a0battle\u00a0is\u00a0a\u00a0chance\u00a0to\u00a0strengthen\u00a0your\u00a0lineup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive\u00a0Fantasy\u00a0Battlefields</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps\u00a0aren\u2019t\u00a0just\u00a0backgrounds!\u00a0Trigger\u00a0hidden\u00a0traps,\u00a0summon\u00a0natural\u00a0disasters,\u00a0or\u00a0use\u00a0terrain\u00a0to\u00a0block\u00a0enemies\u00a0\u2013\u00a0strategy\u00a0gets\u00a0a\u00a0creative\u00a0upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple\u00a0Challenge\u00a0Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20\u00a0meticulously\u00a0designed\u00a0levels\u00a0with\u00a0normal\u00a0&amp;\u00a0nightmare\u00a0difficulties,\u00a0balancing\u00a0new\u00a0player\u00a0guidance\u00a0and\u00a0hardcore\u00a0precision\u00a0gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic\u00a0Choices,\u00a0Infinite\u00a0Outcomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning\u00a0Mastery\u00a0\u2013\u00a0Place\u00a0units\u00a0to\u00a0maximize\u00a0synergy\u00a0and\u00a0create\u00a0impenetrable\u00a0defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource\u00a0Tactics\u00a0\u2013\u00a0Rush\u00a0upgrades\u00a0with\u00a0resources\u00a0or\u00a0grind\u00a0for\u00a0organic\u00a0growth?\u00a0The\u00a0choice\u00a0shapes\u00a0your\u00a0army\u2019s\u00a0strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build\u00a0Diversity\u00a0\u2013\u00a0Focus\u00a0on\u00a0frontline\u00a0durability\u00a0or\u00a0backline\u00a0burst\u00a0damage?\u00a0Random\u00a0loot\u00a0drops\u00a0demand\u00a0flexible\u00a0strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team\u00a0Synergy\u00a0\u2013\u00a0Balance\u00a0long-range\u00a0snipers,\u00a0melee\u00a0bruisers,\u00a0and\u00a0support\u00a0units\u00a0to\u00a0crush\u00a0every\u00a0threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build\u00a0your\u00a0legacy.\u00a0Defend\u00a0the\u00a0light.\u00a0Conquer\u00a0the\u00a0chaos.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Vanguard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s